CYBRA MODULE 17 — LICENSE & CONTRACT MENU CONTROLLER

01. CYBRA license rate is 100 basis points.
02. 100 basis points equals 1 percent.
03. License calculation uses the frozen contract amount.
04. License amount = contract amount × 1%.
05. License calculation must be deterministic.
06. License payer must be explicitly identified.
07. License recipient must be explicitly identified.
08. License context must identify the contract.
09. License context must identify the order.
10. License context must identify the terms.
11. License context must identify chain ID.
12. License context must identify the license rate.
13. License context must identify the license amount.
14. License context must be hashable.
15. License context hash must remain auditable.
16. License rate cannot silently change after freeze.
17. Contract amount cannot silently change after freeze.
18. License recipient cannot silently change after freeze.
19. License payer cannot silently change after freeze.
20. Double license charge is blocked.
21. A license payment does not establish TRUE_100.
22. A license payment does not authorize release.
23. A license payment does not replace buyer signature.
24. A license payment does not replace seller signature.
25. A license payment does not replace delivery evidence.
26. A license payment does not replace buyer receipt.
27. A license payment does not replace backend consensus.
28. A license payment does not replace watchdog confirmation.
29. A license payment does not replace final authorization.
30. TEST mode cannot automatically send a license transaction.
31. TEST mode cannot automatically send a release transaction.
32. The controller cannot manufacture a user signature.
33. The controller cannot manufacture wallet authorization.
34. MetaMask interaction remains a user action.
35. The menu is an interface/controller layer.
36. The menu cannot bypass contract security.
37. The menu cannot bypass TRUE_100.
38. The menu cannot bypass escrow.
39. The menu cannot bypass final authorization.
40. Menu state must remain auditable.
41. Frozen state requires a new PATCH_ID for changes.
42. Corrections create new evidence.
43. Previous frozen snapshots remain immutable.
44. Real transaction execution is disabled in TEST.
45. GLOBAL_TRUE_100 remains false in this module.
46. Module TRUE_100 means the module's own required tests are complete.
47. License fee must not be represented as a guaranteed return.
48. License fee must not be represented as a guarantee of contract performance.
49. Exact fee calculation must be independently verifiable.
50. Any rounding policy must be explicit.
